-- title:
--   Sidorenko's inequality for sides of size at most $2$
-- statement:
--   **The rung $r=2$ of the scaled Sidorenko conjecture.** For every finite graph $H$ admitting a bipartition with at most two vertices on each side, and every finite graph $G$ with at least one vertex,
--
--   $$t(H,G)\ \ge\ t(K_2,G)^{\,e(H)}.$$
-- source:
--   A. F. Sidorenko, Inequalities for functionals generated by bipartite graphs, Discrete Math. Appl. 2 (1992), https://doi.org/10.1515/dma.1992.2.5.489 (bipartite graphs with at most four vertices on one side; also trees and even cycles)

